From dced3c52cbab462b9c4d8133b823c0d6ba48b15c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:18:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Updater: unpack while the game runs, with a progress bar in
 the game's own window and no console

A hidden script unpacks the release into a staging folder (new textures go straight in; textures.ini is replaced) and reports its progress through a file, which the update question shows as an 'Unpacking' bar. When it is done the game closes, the script moves the staged files over the game's and starts it again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
